WEBVTT

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:38.540
Because of the destruction
of Hellmaster Phibrizzo...

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:43.370
...a dramatic change has come to the
continent centered around Seyruun.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.100
The Monster race's barrier
which has surrounded this land...

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:49.840
...for a thousand years since the War
of the Monsters' Fall, has been broken!

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.450
Now a bunch of kings
have joined forces...

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:57.010
...to send a delegation
into the outer world.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:00.320
But then, just as they
were about to set out...

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.190
...they were suddenly
attacked by a golden dragon!

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.870
But then who should appear but
the beautiful sorcery genius...

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.030
Lina Inverse!

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.270
Thanks to Lina's actions,
the dragon was beaten back!

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:13.730
But now what?!
Without realizing it...

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:17.140
...the ship we're on ends up
without any way to steer it!

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:19.510
We can't go back to the port now!

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:24.640
All right, then! Let's set
off for the outer world!

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:29.420
We're off on a new adventure,
with the whole world our stage!

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.680
So... hungry...

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:09.130
Our new adventure may be
coming to a quick end...

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.690
That's why... I always say...

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:18.260
...it's not good to do things
without... thinking about them...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:25.000
I never expected we'd lose
all our food in that fight.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:32.680
Hey.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.790
It's been seven days now...

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.350
Do you think we're
going to die?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.830
There's no way we're
going to die here!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.960
...is what I'd like to say, but we
should prepare to do it.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.770
Oh... What a short life I had...

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.740
Bird! Roast chicken!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:08.180
Hold it! If there are birds here,
then we must be near land!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.170
Land?

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.170
LAND!!!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.100
Now we can get some FOOD!

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.600
Let's go, Miss Lina!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:27.660
All right!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.800
Bom Di Wind!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:43.050
Bom Di Wind! Bom Di Wind!
Bom Di Wind! Bom Di Wind!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.090
Food!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.590
Just you wait!

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.720
I'll eat the center
of that whole town!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.840
You're saying you still haven't
found it? The last one?

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.770
Yes, sir.

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:04.240
We already know who
has the Sword of Light.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.710
Only one more...
We have to find the final one!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:09.780
Yes, sir!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.800
All right, you guys!
Don't let anything distract you!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.770
Boss, what ARE we looking for?

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.240
Look, just bring back anything
that looks weird, okay?

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:11.910
Aye, aye, sir!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.940
And also... Any treasure
you might find, too.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.350
Aye, aye, SI R!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:28.920
Shake a leg! Bring me anything
that's even a little suspicious!

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.730
Gimme your money!
C'mon, hand it over!

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:33.960
Mercy! Have mercy!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:59.720
Food! Food!
Food! Food! Food!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.630
Please, help us! We beg you!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.170
What's going on?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.230
Looks like they're being
attacked by somebody.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:14.160
Who are you?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.110
These guys are strangers.
Weird scent on them.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:20.580
You shut your MOUTH!!!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.280
Keeping starving people from
eating after they finally make it...

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.410
...to land is inexcusable and
worthy of divine punishment!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:34.920
Yeah! There's no telling what being
this hungry has done to us!

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.630
Who ARE you people?!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:40.860
People who keep me from eating
don't deserve to know my name!

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.230
What?!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.170
You attack innocent people and
force them to give you their money!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:49.070
In other words, that is absolutely,
positively wrong!

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.840
In the name ofJustice,
Love, Truth, and Food...

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:54.180
...I, Amelia, shall smite you
with the Hammer ofJustice!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.820
Hold it! What was that "food"
part on the end all about?!

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:01.080
In any case, why don't you
just turn tail and run home?

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.960
No telling what may happen
to you if you don't.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:05.420
Shut up! Just SHUT UP!

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:08.290
Go on, guys! Take care of them!

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:13.060
If you still intend to fight us,
we will show you no mercy!

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.700
Let's go, Gourry!

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:17.930
Vis-Fan Rank!

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.450
Flare Arrow!

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.120
Light, come forth!

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:41.590
Wh- Who are these guys?!
Monsters?!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.100
Food!

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:48.830
Boss! His sword!

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:53.140
The Sword of Light? Is that it?!
But, how can it be?!

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:57.170
How'd it end up in the
hands of this fiend?!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:02.110
Now that we know this,
time for the kids' games to end.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.580
Do it, Jillas!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:08.050
All right! CATCH!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.540
Food!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:17.520
What was that?!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.230
A bomb. Rezo did research
into them before.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.630
It's a weapon you light
on fire and then explodes.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:27.400
Explodes?!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.810
Well, we shouldn't
be too surprised.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.740
At the very least, they aren't
as strong as explosion spells.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.510
That's why Rezo abandoned
his research into them.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:40.280
What are you all mumbling about?!
Try these on for size!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:42.180
Oh, give me a boom!
A big kaboom!

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:43.920
AQUA CREATE!

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.090
They're all wet!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:53.860
You wanted an explosion, right?
Try this! MEGA BRAND!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.240
You... You're a sorceress?!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.530
You're just figuring that out now?!
I dunno who gave me the name...

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.080
...but I am the beautiful
sorcery genius!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.280
Look out!

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.680
It bounced off?!
But that's impossible!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.390
Too bad for you...

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.830
...but my body is part rock
golem and... B... Oh!

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:30.860
Rock golem and bow?

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:34.530
Your flying tools might be
something to watch out for.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.840
All right, let's get serious
and get our food!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.680
Uh, wait a second...

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:41.640
Garuk Ruhard!

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:43.710
Burst Flare!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.580
Food! Food! Food!

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:05.990
Here, your reward for saving us.
Eat all you want.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.320
Um... Oh, you've
already started...

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.580
We're far south of
the Desert of Destruction...

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.380
Is this place already
outside of the barrier?

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:48.020
Ooh, now I'm satisfied.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.370
I never thought food could
ever taste that good.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.700
Same with me!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.000
Excuse me? Are you
all feeling better now?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.100
Well, you really saved us.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:01.740
They've been stealing everything
they can get their hands on.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:04.870
All the towns in the area
have been attacked by them.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.840
Well, after what
happened to them...

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.610
...I doubt they'll be
coming near here again.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.990
I don't think they'll
ever come back here!

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.590
Yeah, exactly. Hm?

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.660
H-H-Huh?!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:23.590
What?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.960
What is it? What is it?!

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.530
That golden dragon from before!

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:32.940
It can't be! I thought you blasted
it with your Dragon Slave!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:35.500
Amelia! Gourry! Follow me!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:36.340
Lina!

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.170
I know!

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:43.720
What's going on here?!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.980
- Just follow it!
- It looks like it's landing!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:17.710
Y-Y-You?!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.960
If we had some tasty cookies,
too, this would be perfect.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.770
Oh, my. Aren't you
going to try it?

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:38.270
What is going on here?!
Who are you?!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.640
What are you after?!
Start explaining!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:48.580
Of course. There's something
that I must ask of you all.

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.610
Is she a friend of yours?

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:51.850
Well, sort of.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.420
About me...
What you call the "outer world"...

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:58.150
...this world, in other words,
is where I am a priestess...

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.220
...at the temple of
the Fire Dragon King.

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.090
A priestess of
the Fire Dragon King?

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.560
You're a priestess
of the Dragon race?

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:04.730
Yes.

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.040
Then, that tail I saw...

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:12.000
Yes. I'm still not used
to taking human form.

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.500
Occasionally, my tail shows.

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.240
Wow... You can really do that?

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:21.220
I've heard that it's an easy thing
for high-level dragons to perform.

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:25.840
Mr. Milgasia, who helped us in
the Katahto mountains, could do it.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:31.080
Okay, whatever. So, why'd we get
attacked by a dragon priestess?

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:35.020
When I did, I was confirming
your power, as I said I would.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.890
Confirming our power?

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:38.900
So you attacked a town
to do THAT?!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.470
Destroying the town
wasn't my intention.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.840
YOU did that with
your spell, Miss Lina.

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:47.470
Besides, if you couldn't handle
something like that...

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:50.210
...I doubt you'd be able to
survive what's ahead of you.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:51.670
What's ahead of us?

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:57.010
Yes. You must follow a prophecy
which foretells destruction.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.780
A prophecy of destruction?

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.260
The Sword of Light...
What is Gorun Nova doing there?!

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.030
A real shocker, huh?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:16.730
That must be one of the weapons
Lord Valgaav wants us to find.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.940
I don't know what
it's doing there, but...

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:22.180
This all began several weeks ago...

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:26.070
...when we received a premonition at
the temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.050
"There shall come a
controller of a dark star..."

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.420
"...who shall call forth the light."

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.110
"And the world shall be
flooded with darkness."

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.620
"Dragon's blood shall spread..."

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:37.560
"...and following the power
between light and darkness..."

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.560
"...a single star
shall be awakened."

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.530
"Around the star
shall spin five lights."

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:44.960
"And the power shall be
a darkness beyond twilight."

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:47.090
"A brilliance beyond the dawn."

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:50.210
"When the power is loosed,
we shall fall to an arrow..."

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:53.330
"...which will split
the heavens apart."

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.310
Those were the words
of the prophecy.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.210
What is it?

00:15:58.820 --> 00:15:59.780
What does it mean?

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:03.580
The first part, about darkness
consuming the world...

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:08.060
...means that the world
faces a grave danger.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.350
The next part, " the power
between light and darkness"...

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:16.560
...we think may refer to humans.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:22.260
Those who live
between light and darkness...

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.930
The ones who are
neither Gods nor Monsters.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:27.870
The rest of it still doesn't
make sense to us.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:33.720
We've decided that a human is
the key to avoiding this danger...

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.620
...and so we set out to find
someone with enough power.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.350
A human... To save
the world... Miss Lina?

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.790
Sorry. Oh, man, that's the
funniest thing I ever heard!

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.990
So, there's some nonsense
about a threat to the world...

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.360
...and suddenly I'm the
representative of the human race?

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:53.060
Gee, I'm kinda honored!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.210
No, you're not the representative.
You're the fill-in.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.240
What do you mean?!
Didn't you just say...

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.300
...you had to choose the
most powerful human of all?!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:09.240
The truth is, we asked
somebody before we asked you.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:12.620
But they were too busy with their
part-time job to be bothered.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:16.250
So, we fell back
to you, Miss Lina.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.420
You fell back to?!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.150
Yes.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.600
And after testing
all of your power...

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:25.500
...I believe the four of you
should be enough to do this.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.200
You've gotta be kidding!

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.000
Why should I go and follow
some nonsense and risk my life...

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.970
...after you go and
call me a stand-in?!

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.980
You won't accept this mission?

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:38.670
Of course not! You can go back to
your first choice, can't you?!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:42.580
Well, she said you
might be against it.

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:46.250
Our original choice gave
us this letter for you.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.050
What is this thing?

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.520
Miss Lina?

00:17:56.600 --> 00:18:00.060
Your first choice... Was her
part-time job being a waitress?

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.130
Yes.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.570
Lina?

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.230
Miss Lina?! Miss Lina?!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.560
Lina!

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.490
What's wrong?!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.660
What's in this letter?!

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:32.730
Wow, it's a really
simple letter, isn't it?

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.100
"Shut up and do it!"
Signed, "Sis."

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.700
Definitely simple, all right.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:38.570
Signed "Sis"?! You mean!

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:39.730
Lina's big sister?!

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:42.740
AGH!!! She's gonna kill me!

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.640
She's going to kill her?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.680
Well, she DI D say that...

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.120
...she'd punish her badly
if Miss Lina refused, but...

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:52.450
LI NA has a sister that
she's that scared of?

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.720
What is she like?

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:58.550
Sis, forgive me! Forgive me!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.100
I see. The Sword of Light...

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:06.160
Gorun Nova has
finally left the barrier.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:07.800
It looks that way.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:10.230
And so has Lina Inverse...

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:11.700
Lina Inverse?!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:14.740
You've discovered Gorun Nova?

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:15.470
Yes.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:18.340
I knew who possessed Gorun
Nova from the beginning.

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:21.680
In that case, there is
only one thing left to do.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:24.580
I promise!
We'll get hold of that sword!

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:27.180
No. This is too important
to leave to you.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:32.960
There is one other thing in this world
as powerful as the Sword of Light.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.760
I want you to find it!

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:35.690
Yes, sir!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:40.600
I'll take the Sword of Light
and kill Lina Inverse myself!

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:44.760
Just wait, Lina Inverse...

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.990
Were you off crying alone?

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.020
You were the one
who made me do that!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:00.920
So...

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.890
Do you feel like
accepting the job now?

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:07.830
Whether I do or not doesn't matter.
I can't disobey my sister!

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:10.770
I take it your older sister
is your weak point.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.570
I'd prefer fighting a dark
lord a hundred times more...

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:17.040
...than facing my sister
armed with a bamboo stick!

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.140
She's that bad? Well, uh...

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:23.300
In any case, I'm relieved
you've accepted the job.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:27.320
Besides that... If Sis told me
to do it, it means something else.

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:31.420
When someone as strict, scary,
strong, and crazy as my sister...

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:33.790
...says this,
one thing's very clear.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:37.160
You mean the fact that she's
really scared of this?

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:43.460
Anyway, I wonder what
we should do now.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:47.800
First of all, we go to the temple of
the Fire Dragon King, which I serve.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:50.430
Our elder is waiting there.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.470
Oh, boy... Fine.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:57.440
Care to join the team?

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:27.360
Who's that suspicious
person we keep seeing?

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:29.970
Hold it! You don't
suppose it's HI M, do you?!

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:33.060
Next time:
"Where'd That Arrogant Guy Go?"

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:36.170
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
